-- src:4763 | (i) unless, in a case where the VCC was dissolved
-- src:4764 | following its winding up under Part 11 of the VCC
-- src:4765 | Act, a period of at least 2 years has passed after the
-- src:4766 | date of dissolution; or
-- src:4768 | (ii) unless, in a case where the VCC was dissolved
-- src:4769 | following its name being struck off the register under
