@ref s 27(1A) (src:4692-4772)
GIVEN holder IS A `s 27(1A) earlier holder of the name`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 27(1A) the years that must pass after the date of dissolution, cancellation or cessation` MEANS
    CONSIDER holder
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(a)(i) a company dissolved following its winding up under the Insolvency, Restructuring and Dissolution Act 2018` THEN 2
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(a)(ii) a company dissolved following its name being struck off the register under section 344 or 344A` THEN 6
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(b) a person whose registration and registration of the business name has been cancelled under the Business Names Registration Act 2014 or had ceased under section 22 of that Act` THEN 1
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(c) a foreign company notice of the dissolution of which has been given to the Registrar under section 377(2)` THEN 2
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(d)(i) a limited liability partnership dissolved following its winding up under section 39 of, and the Fifth Schedule to, the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005` THEN 2
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(d)(ii) a limited liability partnership dissolved following its name being struck off the register under section 63 of the Limited Liability Partnerships Act 2005` THEN 6
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(e)(i) a limited partnership the registration of which was cancelled under section 14(1) or 19(4) of the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` THEN 1
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(e)(ii) a limited partnership of which notice was lodged with the Registrar of Limited Partnerships that it was dissolved under section 19(2) of the Limited Partnerships Act 2008` THEN 1
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(f)(i) a VCC dissolved following its winding up under Part 11 of the VCC Act` THEN 2
    WHEN `s 27(1A)(f)(ii) a VCC dissolved following its name being struck off the register under section 344 or 344A as applied by section 130B of the VCC Act` THEN 6

-- (1A): "the Registrar must, on or after 3 January 2016, except with the Minister's consent, refuse to register a company under a name, if — (a) it is identical to the name of a company that was dissolved — (i) unless ... a period of at least 2 years has passed ...".
-- JUST TRUE: the name is identical, the years have not passed, and the Minister has not consented. Where the name is not identical (the "if" fails) the text says no (reading (a), fork line F-I4); where the "unless" or the "except" is met the text is silent (NOTHING; fork line F-I18).
